{"no":12,"stage":2,"part":"A","title_en":"Noun + adjective: phrase or sentence?","title_ar":"الصِّفَةُ بَعْدَ الِاسْمِ","q_en":"Is “noun + adjective” one idea, or a full sentence?","q_ar":"هَلْ هِيَ عِبَارَةٌ أَمْ جُمْلَةٌ؟","not_yet":["Phrases as the topic of a longer sentence: later.","Adjectives before the noun: Arabic does not do that.","More adjectives (long lists): you will meet them in reading."],"not_yet_ar":["عِبَارَةٌ تَكُونُ مُبْتَدَأً فِي جُمْلَةٍ أَطْوَلَ: فِيمَا بَعْدُ.","لَا تَأْتِي الْكَلِمَةُ الَّتِي تَصِفُ الِاسْمَ قَبْلَهُ فِي الْعَرَبِيَّةِ.","قَوَائِمُ طَوِيلَةٌ مِنْ هَذِهِ الْكَلِمَاتِ: سَتَرَاهَا فِي الْقِرَاءَةِ."],"slides":[{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: phrases (one idea)","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ","mode":"kind","sents":[["الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ","nn","the new book"],["كِتَابٌ جَدِيدٌ","nn","a new book"],["الْمَدْرَسَةُ الْكَبِيرَةُ","nn","the big school"],["مَدْرَسَةٌ كَبِيرَةٌ","nn","a big school"]],"legend":[["n","Phrase"]]},{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: sentences (a statement)","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ","mode":"kind","sents":[["الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ.","nm","The book is new."],["الْمَدْرَسَةُ كَبِيرَةٌ.","nm","The school is big."],["الْمَاءُ بَارِدٌ.","nm","The water is cold."],["الشَّمْسُ حَارَّةٌ.","nm","The sun is hot."]],"legend":[["n","Topic"],["m","Statement"]]},{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: in the mosque","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ","mode":"kind","sents":[["الْإِمَامُ الْكَرِيمُ","nn","the generous imam"],["الْإِمَامُ كَرِيمٌ.","nm","The imam is generous."],["مَسْجِدٌ مُبَارَكٌ","nn","a blessed mosque"],["الْمَجْلِسُ طَيِّبٌ.","nm","The gathering is pleasant."]],"legend":[["n","Phrase / topic"],["m","Statement"]]},{"t":"bullets","head_en":"Notice","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ وَلَاحِظْ","lines":[["Does the second word have ال in الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ?","هَلْ فِي الْكَلِمَةِ الثَّانِيَةِ «الْ» فِي «الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ»؟"],["And in الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ? What is different?","وَفِي «الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ»؟ مَا الْفَرْقُ؟"],["Can you say “a new book” as a full sentence? What is it saying about the book?","هَلْ «كِتَابٌ جَدِيدٌ» جُمْلَةٌ تَامَّةٌ؟ مَاذَا تَقُولُ عَنِ الْكِتَابِ؟"]]},{"t":"pairs","head_en":"Same words, different meaning","head_ar":"الْكَلِمَاتُ نَفْسُهَا","la":"Phrase","lb":"Sentence","ca":"o","cb":"g","rows":[["الْمَاءُ الْبَارِدُ","the cold water","الْمَاءُ بَارِدٌ","The water is cold."],["الْبَيْتُ الْكَبِيرُ","the big house","الْبَيْتُ كَبِيرٌ","The house is big."],["الْمَدِينَةُ الْقَدِيمَةُ","the old city","الْمَدِينَةُ قَدِيمَةٌ","The city is old."]],"tip":"Look at the second word: ال = phrase. Tanwīn = sentence.","tip_ar":"اُنْظُرْ إِلَى الْكَلِمَةِ الثَّانِيَةِ: «الْ» = عِبَارَةٌ. تَنْوِينٌ = جُمْلَةٌ."},{"t":"rule","head_en":"The adjective copies the noun, or makes a sentence","head_ar":"مُتَشَابِهَانِ فِي «الْ» = عِبَارَةٌ. مُخْتَلِفَانِ = جُمْلَةٌ.","cards":[{"title_ar":"الْ + الْ","title_en":"Both have ال","def_en":"phrase: the new book","ex":"الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ","col":"o"},{"title_ar":"بِلَا + بِلَا","title_en":"Neither has ال","def_en":"phrase: a new book","ex":"كِتَابٌ جَدِيدٌ","col":"o"},{"title_ar":"الْ + بِلَا","title_en":"ال on the first only","def_en":"SENTENCE: The book is new.","ex":"الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ","col":"g"}]},{"t":"table","head_en":"How to decide","head_ar":"كَيْفَ أَعْرِفُ؟","headers":["Example","ال on the noun?","ال on the adjective?","What is it?"],"rows":[["الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ","yes","yes","phrase: the new book"],["كِتَابٌ جَدِيدٌ","no","no","phrase: a new book"],["الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ","yes","no","sentence: The book is new."]],"cols":["x","x","x","m"],"note":"The adjective also copies the noun’s gender and number (Lesson 10).","note_ar":"وَالْكَلِمَةُ الثَّانِيَةُ تُطَابِقُ الِاسْمَ فِي الْجِنْسِ وَالْعَدَدِ (الدَّرْسُ الْعَاشِرُ)."},{"t":"look","head_en":"Look: gender and number as well","head_ar":"اُنْظُرْ","mode":"kind","sents":[["الْبُيُوتُ الْكَبِيرَةُ","nn","the big houses"],["الْبُيُوتُ كَبِيرَةٌ.","nm","The houses are big."],["الطُّلَّابُ السَّعِيدُونَ","nn","the happy students"],["الطُّلَّابُ سَعِيدُونَ.","nm","The students are happy."]],"legend":[["n","Phrase / topic"],["m","Statement"]]},{"t":"quiz","head_en":"Try: phrase or sentence?","kinds":"nvnvnnnvnv","items":[["الْمَاءُ الْبَارِدُ","Phrase: the cold water"],["الْمَاءُ بَارِدٌ","Sentence: The water is cold."],["بَيْتٌ كَبِيرٌ","Phrase: a big house"],["الدَّرْسُ سَهْلٌ","Sentence: The lesson is easy."],["الشَّمْسُ الْحَارَّةُ","Phrase: the hot sun"],["الدَّرْسُ السَّهْلُ","Phrase: the easy lesson"],["مَدِينَةٌ جَمِيلَةٌ","Phrase: a beautiful city"],["الطَّعَامُ جَيِّدٌ","Sentence: The food is good."],["مَسْجِدٌ مُبَارَكٌ","Phrase: a blessed mosque"],["الْإِمَامُ كَرِيمٌ","Sentence: The imam is generous."]]},{"t":"mistake","wrong":"الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ","why":"A girl says: “الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ means The book is new.” Wrong! Both words have ال, so it is only a phrase: the new book. For the sentence say الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ.","why_ar":"تَقُولُ بِنْتٌ: «الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ» تَعْنِي: الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ. خَطَأٌ! فِي الْكَلِمَتَيْنِ «الْ»، فَهِيَ عِبَارَةٌ فَقَطْ. وَلِلْجُمْلَةِ قُلْ: الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ."}],"can":["I can tell a phrase (the new book) from a sentence (The book is new).","I can add an adjective that matches the noun."],"can_ar":["أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أُمَيِّزَ الْعِبَارَةَ (الْكِتَابُ الْجَدِيدُ) مِنَ الْجُمْلَةِ (الْكِتَابُ جَدِيدٌ).","أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أُضِيفَ كَلِمَةً تُطَابِقُ الِاسْمَ."],"covers":"Lesson 12: noun + adjective  ·  includes Lessons 1–11","covers_ar":"الدَّرْسُ الثَّانِيَ عَشَرَ: الِاسْمُ وَمَا يَصِفُهُ  ·  مَعَ مُرَاجَعَةِ الدُّرُوسِ ١–١١","words":[{"lesson":12,"ar":"جَيِّد","en":"good (quality)","pos":"adj"},{"lesson":12,"ar":"سَيِّئ","en":"bad","pos":"adj"},{"lesson":12,"ar":"بَارِد","en":"cold","pos":"adj"},{"lesson":12,"ar":"حَارّ","en":"hot","pos":"adj"}],"sections":[{"name":"A","kind":"passage","role":"comp","en":"Read the sentences. Then answer.","ins":"اِقْرَأِ النَّصَّ ثُمَّ أَجِبْ.","lines":[["الْمَسْجِدُ كَبِيرٌ.","nn","The mosque is big."],["الْمَجْلِسُ طَيِّبٌ.","nn","The gathering is pleasant."],["الْإِمَامُ صَالِحٌ.","nn","The imam is righteous."],["الْحَبِيبُ كَرِيمٌ.","nn","The Habib is generous."],["الْمَاءُ بَارِدٌ.","nn","The water is cold."],["الذِّكْرُ طَيِّبٌ.","nn","Dhikr is good."]],"review":false,"items":[{"ar":null,"en":"What is cold?","ar_q":"مَا الْبَارِدُ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["the water","the Habib","false","true"],"answer":"the water","model":"the water","note":null,"id":"e8724139"},{"ar":null,"en":"Who is righteous?","ar_q":"مَنِ الصَّالِحُ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["the imam","the Habib","the gathering","true"],"answer":"the imam","model":"the imam","note":null,"id":"d0d191bd"},{"ar":null,"en":"Who is generous?","ar_q":"مَنِ الْكَرِيمُ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["the imam","the water","the Habib","true"],"answer":"the Habib","model":"the Habib","note":null,"id":"b398716f"},{"ar":null,"en":"What is pleasant?","ar_q":"مَا الطَّيِّبُ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["the gathering","true","the water","false"],"answer":"the gathering","model":"the gathering","note":null,"id":"3b7beaea"},{"ar":null,"en":"Find the word that means “big”.","ar_q":"أَيُّ كَلِمَةٍ فِي النَّصِّ تَدُلُّ عَلَى الْكِبَرِ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["false","the imam","the Habib","كَبِيرٌ"],"answer":"كَبِيرٌ","model":"كَبِيرٌ","note":null,"id":"a064b76f"},{"ar":null,"en":"Make line 3 a phrase: “the righteous imam”.","ar_q":"اجْعَلِ السَّطْرَ الثَّالِثَ عِبَارَةً.","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["الْإِمَامُ الصَّالِحُ","the water","كَبِيرٌ","false"],"answer":"الْإِمَامُ الصَّالِحُ","model":"الْإِمَامُ الصَّالِحُ","note":null,"id":"2281854e"},{"ar":"الْمَاءُ حَارٌّ.","en":"True or false?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["the imam","the water","false","true"],"answer":"false","model":"false (the water is cold)","note":"the water is cold","id":"2e17838d"},{"ar":"الْمَسْجِدُ كَبِيرٌ.","en":"True or false?","ar_q":nu